#: src/ci.md:157
msgid "This solve two issues:"
msgstr ""

#: src/ci.md:159
msgid ""
"`REDOXER_QEMU_ARGS: \"-smp 1\"` ensures there's no flaky test caused by high "
"contention in kernel multi-threading, which is an open issue to this day."
msgstr ""

#: src/ci.md:160
msgid ""
"`ln -sf /root/.redoxer ~/.redoxer` fixes a missing toolchain and image "
"problem because GitHub does not run as `/root`, but as `/github/home`. "
"GitLab does not have this problem."
msgstr ""
